---
// Flagship technical investigations feature block for the homepage.
// Replaces the single-topic CSI feature with the triad of empirical investigations:
// Storage Rate Monitor, KC Municipal Permits, and Wi-Fi CSI.
---

<section id="investigations" class="inv-feature">
  <div class="wrap wrap--wide">
    <header class="inv-feature__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Featured engineering · Flagship investigations</p>
      <h2 class="inv-feature__title">Pipelines that know when they're lying to you.</h2>
      <p class="inv-feature__sub">
        Three deep-dive investigations built around empirical verification: 
        longitudinal pricing observatories, multi-jurisdiction public-record qualification, and hardware RF link forensics.
        Each designed around the controls that proved what was actually being measured.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="inv-feature__grid">
      <!-- Door 1: Storage Price Observatory / PSA Prediction -->
      <article class="inv-door">
        <div class="inv-door__top">
          <span class="inv-door__tag">Storage Price Observatory</span>
          <span class="inv-door__num">01</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="inv-door__title">Both Sides of the Discount Moved</h3>
        <p class="inv-door__copy">
          A seven-source pricing monitor covering 9,077 facilities, an August rate-hike anomaly, and a pre-registered bet on Public Storage's (PSA) Q3 earnings.
        </p>

        <div class="inv-door__metric">
          <strong>9,077</strong>
          <span>facilities tracked daily across 129,704 advertised units</span>
        </div>

        <ul class="inv-door__list">
          <li><strong>Sealed Q3 prediction:</strong> Pre-registered bet that PSA promotional discount and rate growth will decelerate YoY.</li>
          <li><strong>The August 1st event:</strong> 4,904 listings moved into "40% off" and every one received an immediate reference-rate hike (median +$45).</li>
          <li><strong>Living ledger:</strong> Logged the September 14 reset and its subsequent 12% partial walkback four days later in real time.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="inv-door__action">
          <a href="/storage" class="inv-door__link">
            <span>Read prediction & rate monitor</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Door 2: KC Permits -->
      <article class="inv-door">
        <div class="inv-door__top">
          <span class="inv-door__tag">Civic Data Integrity</span>
          <span class="inv-door__num">02</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="inv-door__title">The Verification Filter</h3>
        <p class="inv-door__copy">
          Turning 57,032 civic observations across 30,587 locations into 4 verifiable commercial opportunities without hallucinatory leads or naive matching.
        </p>

        <div class="inv-door__metric">
          <strong>57,032</strong>
          <span>observations resolved into 4 prospect actions (37 → 10 → 4)</span>
        </div>

        <ul class="inv-door__list">
          <li><strong>The naive scraping myth:</strong> Permits name contractors not tenants, addresses collide, and speculative filings have no buyer.</li>
          <li><strong>Tyler EnerGov reverse engineering:</strong> Extracted undocumented multi-tenant API headers across Olathe, OP, and KCMO.</li>
          <li><strong>Silent failures caught:</strong> Detected portals with silent 10,000-row query truncation caps and engineered audit rails.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="inv-door__action">
          <a href="/permits" class="inv-door__link">
            <span>Read lead qualification audit</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Door 3: CSI: Room or Radio? -->
      <article class="inv-door">
        <div class="inv-door__top">
          <span class="inv-door__tag">Embedded RF & Signal Processing</span>
          <span class="inv-door__num">03</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="inv-door__title">Room or Radio?</h3>
        <p class="inv-door__copy">
          A Wi-Fi CSI system identified devices at 99.7% accuracy. Physical controls broke the device-identity claim—and revealed a physical link state instead.
        </p>

        <div class="inv-door__metric">
          <strong>69.5M</strong>
          <span>clean beacon frames replayed across 8 paired overnight captures</span>
        </div>

        <ul class="inv-door__list">
          <li><strong>The seductive number:</strong> 99.7% accuracy identifying ESP32 transmitters by subcarrier phase slope.</li>
          <li><strong>The hypothesis ledger:</strong> 29 distinct ideas killed across 35 rejection tests, proving what the feature wasn't before claiming what it was.</li>
          <li><strong>The double difference:</strong> Two receivers watching the same pair disagreed by 6.79 standard deviations.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="inv-door__action">
          <a href="/csi" class="inv-door__link">
            <span>Open full RF investigation</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="inv-feature__footer">
      <a href="/investigations" class="inv-feature__hub-link">
        Compare all three investigations on the Investigations Hub →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .inv-feature {
    padding-block: clamp(60px, 9vw, 110px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .inv-feature__head {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .inv-feature__title {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .inv-feature__sub {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .inv-feature__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .inv-feature__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .inv-door {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 28px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--bg);
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .inv-door:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .inv-door__top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .inv-door__tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .inv-door__num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .inv-door__title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .inv-door__copy {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .inv-door__metric {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    padding-block: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .inv-door__metric strong {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .inv-door__metric span {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .inv-door__list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .inv-door__list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 14px;
  }

  .inv-door__list li::before {
    content: "▪";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .inv-door__list strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .inv-door__action {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }

  .inv-door__link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: gap 0.15s ease;
  }

  .inv-door__link:hover {
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .inv-feature__footer {
    margin-top: 36px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .inv-feature__hub-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .inv-feature__hub-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border-color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
